    "en": "Ten cheerful moments with beloved cats and dogs, from garden play and sunny windows to picnics and quiet companionship.",
    "ja": "庭遊びや日向ぼっこ、ピクニックまで、猫と犬が寄り添う笑顔いっぱいの10のひとときです。"
  },
